{"id":"suivante","lemma":"suivante","pos":"noun","rank":1947,"glosses":["lady-in-waiting, lady's maid (woman who is a servant to a lady, especially a woman of the nobility or upper class)"],"ipa":"/sɥi.vɑ̃t/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"suivantes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-suivante.wav","examples":[{"text":"Qui est la suivante sur la liste ?","en":"Who's next on the list?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"list"}]},{"text":"Regardez la page suivante.","en":"Look at the next page.","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"page"},null]},{"text":"Personne suivante, s'il vous plaît.","en":"Next person, please.","words":[{"g":"no one, nobody"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to please","l":"plaire"}]},{"text":"C'est l'étape logique suivante.","en":"It's the next logical step.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"stage, stop"},{"g":"logical"},null]},{"text":"Il passa à la question suivante.","en":"He proceeded to the next question.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},null,null,{"g":"question"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a la"]]}]}